A||||9||fotofrank||Duke and rocker arms||||5||
Z||000000||fotofrank||12-14-2001||04:00 PM||||I belive the 'ole duke has 1.5:1 ratio rockers. Super Chevy magizine indicake that going to a 1.52:1 ratio on a high rev (7-8K) engine will produce more HP and torq. They also said the a low rev engine (Da Duke) could benifit from a lower retio rocker (1.47:1). Is this true and where could I get 1.4X ratio rockers? I just need a small kick at this time.<P>------------------<BR>Peace and Happiness<BR>Frank and his fotoflash, an '84 SE||||reg||5
Z||000001||RedHaze86SD4||12-14-2001||04:11 PM||||Was told that fieros do good with either Crane Gold race roller rockers or lunati roller rockers, either for the bb Chevy will work and you'll notice a small dif. Anything before 87 and you can use merker (sp) marine type crank with a new cam and the roller rockers and you should be hving fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   If I'm wrong on anything I'll have to tell the guy that did it on his 85 SE  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
